  {
    "sha": "3cb5bc2c48d36cb022a4d2289ae4ace2207d0fe4",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOAQ6CpNoAKDNjYjViYzJjNDhkMzZjYjAyMmE0ZDIyODlhZTRhY2UyMjA3ZDBmZTQ",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Michael Yocca",
        "email": "19916665+mjyocca@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-07-02T16:35:59Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "GitHub",
        "email": "noreply@github.com",
        "date": "2026-07-02T16:35:59Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(search): add experimental -policies flag and initial policy evaluation support to terraform query (#38769)\n\n* Adds experimental policy evaluation support to terraform query via a new -policies flag. The flag accepts one or more policy set directory paths and is gated behind AllowExperimentalFeatures, consistent with how plan, apply, and init handle experimental policy flags.\n* Adds initial policy evaluation groundwork for list block resources. Per-resource evaluation inputs are collected from list block responses using provider-generated configuration, with a legacy state extraction fallback.",
      "tree": {
