      "message": "add Mermaid graph format to terraform graph command (#38719)\n\nAdds a new optional -format=mermaid flag to the terraform graph command, which produces a Mermaid flowchart-type diagram for both resource-only and plan graphs. Without this flag, the DOT format is still produced by default.",
